12
01:06:51,428 --> 01:06:57,428
Me, Myself & Irene is a 2000 American slapstick black comedy film produced, co-written, and
directed by the Farrelly brothers, and starring Jim Carrey and Renée Zellweger.

13
01:12:25,714 --> 01:12:31,714
The film is about a Rhode Island state trooper named Charlie (Carrey) who, after years of continuously suppressing his feelings, suffers a psychotic breakdown that results in a second
personality, Hank, and must deal with his newfound condition while escorting a woman named Irene (Zellweger) who is being hunted by her mob-affiliated ex-boyfriend.

14
01:18:00,000 --> 01:18:06,000
Chris Cooper, Robert Forster, and Richard Jenkins also star.

15
01:23:34,285 --> 01:23:40,285
This was Carrey's first role in a 20th Century Fox film, along with being the
Farrelly brothers' second film with Carrey since Dumb and Dumber (1994).

16
01:29:08,571 --> 01:29:14,571
Filming was done from May 11 to July 29, 1999, in various
locations in Rhode Island and Vermont.

17
01:34:42,857 --> 01:34:48,857
Me, Myself & Irene was released on June 23, 2000, and was a box office success.

18
01:40:17,142 --> 01:40:23,142
It received mixed reviews from film critics.

19
01:45:51,428 --> 01:45:57,428
The film explores themes of schizophrenia, road trip, ex-cop,
aftercreditsstinger, duringcreditsstinger.

20
01:51:25,714 --> 01:51:31,714
The tone is lighthearted.
